<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Lightwave started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Lightwave started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Digital Lightwave Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Furman Selz also said it started coverage of the stock with a buy rating, putting a mid-teen price target on the shares for 1997.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 at 8-3/4.</p>
</text>
